  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the Capacity of the CDEMA Coordinating Unit and Participating States for Implementation of Comprehensive Disaster Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objective of the Action is to support strengthening of the capacity of the CDEMA Coordinating Unit (CU) and the National Disaster Management Offices (NDMOs) for effective implementation, monitoring and evaluation of the Comprehensive Disaster Management (CDM) programme in Participating States.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
